I can't give you very much advice about what to put into your spreadsheet other than export from the CPS first so you have all the correct columns and names for each sheet, then import each of those CSVs into ONE workbook naming each sheet to correspond to the appropriate csv [Channels, Contacts, TG_Lists, Zones, APRS, and DTMF].  <br><br>If you are using libreoffice for your spreadsheet, you can use <a href="https://www.briankoponen.com/libreoffice-export-sheets-csv/" class="postlink">this macro</a> to export each sheet into its own csv.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5571">N0JYZ</a> — Fri Feb 28, 2025 2:22 am</p><hr />
